                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#2r">-2r</locus>ان وعد الله خق والساعة لا ريب فيها قلبم ما ندري ما الساعة</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#21v">-21v</locus>قالوا كذلك قال ربك انه هو الحكيم العليم , قال فما<note>The two last first are written in larger hand and are the first words of the next ǧuz'.</note>
                     </explicit>
                     <note>45:32-51:30, the text ends with the two first words of the next ǧuz' (51:31). Penciled pagination. Verse markers red dots or circles. The name Muḥammad written in large hand and filled with red on fol. 7r. Ornate rendition of letter ʻayn on fol. 11r, of letter ḥā' on fol. 18r. Letters ʻayn, ḥā' and nūn large on folios 19r, 19v, 20r. The first words of Sūrat Qāf written in large hand and traced with red and yellow on fol. 18r.</note>
                     <note/>
